determined by factors such as quality and relative speed. This means that the faster the relative velocity between objects, the higher the damage caused<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766600/extras/8872a0eaffb4d11959219f6fa01defc1.poster.avif?t=1752372048\" width=720 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766600/extras/8872a0eaffb4d11959219f6fa01defc1.webm?t=1752372048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766600/extras/8872a0eaffb4d11959219f6fa01defc1.mp4?t=1752372048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766600/extras/f8337f89a927f3ec560da3dff792e431.poster.avif?t=1752372048\" width=720 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766600/extras/f8337f89a927f3ec560da3dff792e431.webm?t=1752372048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766600/extras/f8337f89a927f3ec560da3dff792e431.mp4?t=1752372048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Geometry Madness is a game in continuous development, and I will be updating it constantly to expand the depth and content of the game.",
